    backlog:hasScoreRationale "Highest value of the three: this is the step the mission names first — granularisation from intent to work — and today one refinement event of any kind satisfies Ready, so a story reaches execution with no analysis of what it needs. Job size small because RefinementEvent already exists with an outcome and an actor; what is added is which concerns apply." ;
    backlog:hasBasisKind backlog:Basis_Judged .
