fw:Goal_OrderVisible backlog:derivesFromScope fw:Scope_Order .
fw:Goal_MissionToWork backlog:derivesFromScope fw:Scope_Build .
fw:Goal_GroundedPractice backlog:derivesFromScope fw:Scope_Build .
