    backlog:hasGherkinText "Given a class with no range property but with instances, When the gate runs, Then it is reported and does not fail the gate." .
fw:Ev_Reach backlog:attestsCriterion fw:AC_EP_Reach_S1 .
fw:R_EP_Reach_S1 a backlog:RefinementEvent ; backlog:refines fw:EP_Reach_S1 ;
    backlog:addressesConcern backlog:Concern_Data ;
    backlog:refinedAt "2026-08-25T17:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:refinedBy backlog:Builder ;
    backlog:hasRefinementOutcome "Two signals, not one. A class reachable only by rdf:type is usable and must not fail a gate; a class with neither a referring property nor an instance is the Package trap. Conflating them would fail 45 classes and make the gate unusable on its first run." .
