    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Four cases verified individually. An artefact with kind and described item is silent; one with no kind is rejected at L2; one describing nothing is rejected at L2; a Done design-definition task producing no artefact raises an advisory rather than a violation, because a design task may legitimately conclude no model is needed. Built to the decisions the grooming refinements recorded and not redesigned: Diagram is not a separate class, artefacts hang off ExecutionTask, and the structure/behaviour split is a property so a query need not list seven kinds. The reachability gate ran before release and the count stayed at 23 — without it, measured beforehand, UseCase and Specification would have shipped unreferenceable." ;
